# Host test build artifacts.
#
# This was an enumerated list of every test binary, and it drifted twice: both
# test_stream_config and test_ctrl were committed as binaries (plus their
# .dSYM bundles) inside unrelated feature commits, because whoever added the
# test added the .cpp here and forgot the artifact line. A list that must be
# edited every time a test is added is a list that will be wrong again.
#
# Pattern instead: the Makefile builds test_<name> from test_<name>.cpp, so
# ignore the products and re-include the sources. Fixtures live in
# test/fixtures/ and never match test_*.
test/test_*
!test/test_*.cpp
!test/test_*.h
test/test_*.dSYM/
